        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86612, Riviera Square Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Riviera Square Cabinet Knob is NEW from Emtek. This stunning kitchen cabinet hardware is available in several modern finish colors. A transitional cabinet knob, the 1-1/4 Inch Riviera Square Cabinet Knob will look great in nearly any home. Each cabinet handle comes packaged individually with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/riviera-rectangular-cabinet-knob-emtek-86613\"><b>Riviera Rectangular Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/riviera-cabinet-pull-emtek-86614\"><b>Riviera Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/riviera-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-86621\"><b>Riviera Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Riviera 1-1/4 Square Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86612-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262439\"><b>Emtek 86612 Specifications (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
